<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard boosts dividend.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard boosts dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co said Friday its board of directors approved an increase in its quarterly dividend to $0.14 per share from $0.12.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable July 9 to shareholders of record June 18.</p>
</text>
